  "Pick a visible enemy **^^Monster^^** or **^^Cavalry^^** unit within 6\" of the target.": "",
  "If this unit charged this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with it to be the target.": "Si esta unidad ha cargado este turno, elige como objetivo una unidad enemiga en combate con ella.",
  "Add 1 to wound rolls for this unit's attacks while it is wholly within enemy territory.": "",
  "If this unit charged this phase, pick an enemy unit in combat with it to be the target.": "Si esta unidad ha cargado esta fase, elige como objetivo una unidad enemiga en combate con ella.",
  "Reaction: Opponent declared a **^^Spell^^** ability for a unit within 30\" of this unit.": "",
  "Ignore negative modifiers to hit rolls and wound rolls for this unit's shooting attacks.": "",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Arcanite^^** unit that has been destroyed to be the target.": "",
