  "Roll a dice for each model in the target unit. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.": "Tira un dado por cada miniatura de la unidad objetivo. Por cada 5+, inflige 1 de daño mortal al objetivo.",
  "Pick a friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Pick a visible enemy unit within 12\" of this unit to be the target then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit within this unit's combat range to be the target.": "",
  "Pick a visible enemy unit within 18\" of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Pick a visible enemy unit within 18\" of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "Elige como objetivo una unidad enemiga visible a 18\" o menos de esta unidad, después haz una tirada de lanzamiento de 2D6.",
  "Pick an objective you do not control and that you controlled earlier in the battle to be the target.": "",
  "Pick up to 2 visible **Flamers of Tzeentch** units wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the targets.": "",
  "Add 2 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Snapping Jaws** for each **fate point** you have.": "",
  "Pick an enemy **^^Hero^^** in combat with this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Subtract 1 from save rolls for combat attacks that target that unit until the start of your next turn.": "",
  "Pick a friendly unit within this unit's combat range to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Add 3 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's melee weapons while you have 6 or more **fate points**.": "",
  "Your hero has the **^^Arcanite^^** keyword and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Arcanite^^** units": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch Wizard^^** wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):\r\nCover, Impassable**": "**Las siguientes habilidades universales de escenografía se aplican a este elemento de escenografía (Terrain, 1.2):\nCover, Impassable**",
  "Roll a number of dice equal to the unmodified charge roll. For each 4+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.": "Tira un número de dados igual a la tirada de carga sin modificar. Por cada 4+, inflige 1 de daño mortal al objetivo.",
  "Pick an enemy unit that had any damage points allocated to it by this unit's attacks this phase to be the target.": "Elige como objetivo una unidad enemiga a la que se hayan asignado puntos de daño mediante los ataques de esta unidad esta fase.",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch Daemon^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Subtract 1 from the Rend characteristic of weapons used for attacks that target this unit in the first battle round.": "",
  "If this unit is not in combat, pick an enemy **^^Manifestation^^** to be the target. Then, make a charge roll of 3D6.": "",
  "Pick a visible friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch Wizard^^** within 3\" of this **^^Manifestation^^** to be the target.": "",
  "Add 1 to wound rolls for attacks made by friendly **^^Arcanite^^** units while they are wholly within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again within 1\" of the target and in combat. This unit has charged.": "",
  "Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again within 1\" of the target and in combat. This unit has charged.": "",
  "Pick an enemy unit that had any damage points allocated to it this turn by this unit's shooting attacks to be the target.": "Elige como objetivo una unidad enemiga a la que se le hayan asignado puntos de daño este turno por los ataques de disparo de esta unidad.",
  "Spend 2 **fate points**. Then, pick a visible friendly **^^Arcanite^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "If this unit has any models carrying an **Antithete Bow**, pick a visible enemy unit within 18\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "The target can use an additional **^^Spell^^** ability this turn, but this unit must be picked to be the target of that spell.": "",
  "The target can use the 'Normal Move' ability as if it were your movement phase, but it must end that move closer to this unit.": "",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero^^** non-**^^Unique Disciples of Tzeentch Daemon^^** unit that has been destroyed to be the target.": "",
  "This unit can use this ability even if it has been destroyed. Pick any number of **^^Burning^^** enemy units to be the targets.": "",
  "If this unit was set up this turn, it can move D3\". That move cannot pass through or end within the combat range of an enemy unit.": "Si esta unidad fue colocada este turno, puede mover D3\". Ese movimiento no puede atravesar ni terminar dentro del alcance de combate de una unidad enemiga.",
  "Add 1 to hit rolls for combat attacks made by friendly **^^Warflock^^** units that target that enemy unit for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "This unit's **Idolarc** is a token. After setting up this unit on the battlefield for the first time, place its **Idolarc** next to it.": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn:\r\n• Halve the target's Move characteristic.\r\n• The effects of the 'Fly' ability do not apply to the target.": "",
  "**Companion** weapons used by friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** units have **Crit (2 Hits)** while they are wholly within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, for the rest of the turn, the target can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if it used a **^^Run^^** ability in the same turn.": "",
  "This unit can only use this ability if it is **masked by illusion**. Pick a model in a friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit to be the target.": "",
  "Subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks that target this unit while it is within the combat range of another friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^* unit.": "",
  "This unit can only use this ability if it is **masked by illusion**. Pick up to 1 other friendly unit that is **masked by illusion** to be the target.": "",
  "Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's melee weapons while this unit is wholly within 12\" of any **^^Manifestations^^** (friendly or enemy).": "",
  "Subtract 1 from the Rend characteristic of weapons used for attacks that target this unit while it is wholly within 12\" of a friendly **Argent Shard**.": "",
  "This unit can immediately use a **^^Spell^^** ability. When it does so, measure the range and visibility of that **^^Spell^^** ability from the target.": "",
  "Each visible friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch Wizard^^** wholly within 12\" of this unit can use a **^^Spell^^** ability as if it were your hero phase.": "",
  "If the unmodified casting roll exceeds the target's Health characteristic, it is automatically destroyed and cannot be replaced for the rest of the battle.": "",
  "If this unit was set up in the same turn, friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** units have **^^Ward (5+)^^** while they are wholly within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "Your hero has the **^^Arcanite^^** and **^^Warflock^^** keywords, the 'Avian Speed' ability, and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Arcanite^^** units": "",
  "Each time a friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit uses the 'Rally' command, you can make 3 additional rally rolls of D6.": "Cada vez que una unidad amiga **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** totalmente a 12\" o menos de esta unidad use la orden 'Rally', puedes hacer 3 tiradas de reagrupamiento de D6 adicionales.",
  "For the rest of the turn, add 1 to the Rend characteristic of melee weapons used by friendly **Kairic Acolytes** units for attacks that target that enemy unit.": "",
  "Set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 9\" of this unit and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "Set up this unit on the battlefield more than 9\" from all enemy units. Then, set up the target wholly within 6\" of this unit and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "This **^^Manifestation^^** must use this ability in each hero phase. Pick each unit (friendly and enemy) within 9\" of this **^^Manifestation^^** to be the targets.": "",
  "Each time a friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch Daemon^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit uses the 'Rally' command, you can make 3 additional rally rolls of D6.": "Cada vez que una unidad amiga **^^Disciples of Tzeentch Daemon^^** totalmente a 12\" o menos de esta unidad use la orden 'Rally', puedes hacer 3 tiradas de reagrupamiento de D6 adicionales.",
  "Roll a D3 for each target. On a 1, the target no longer has the **^^Burning^^** keyword. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.": "",
  "While they are wholly within 12\" of this unit, friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** units can use the 'Redeploy' command even if they were set up in the same turn.": "",
  "Set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 9\" of a battlefield edge and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "Enemy units cannot end a charge move within 1/2\" of a friendly **Argent Shard** that is wholly within 12\" of this unit and was set up on the battlefield in the same turn.": "",
  "Each time a friendly **^^Warflock^^** unit is set up wholly within 12\" of this unit, that **^^Warflock^^** unit can immediately move D3\" but cannot end that move in combat.": "",
  "This unit can move 6\". It can move into combat and must end that move closer to the caster. If this unit was in combat at the start of the move, it must end that move in combat.": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn:\r\n• This unit has **^^Ward (4+)^^**.\r\n• Each time you make an unmodified ward roll of 1-3 for this unit, allocate 1 damage point to the target.": "",
  "While you have 6 or more **fate points**, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons used by friendly **^^Arcanite^^** units while they are wholly within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "If this unit is destroyed, before removing it from play, set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) in reserve **masked by illusion**": "",
  "If this unit is more than 6\" from all enemy units, it can move **X**\", where **X** is the number of **fate points** you have. It cannot move into combat during any part of that move.": "",
  "Your hero has the **^^Daemon^^** and **^^Ward (6+)^^** keywords, the 'Locus of Summoning' ability,  and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Disciples of Tzeentch Daemon^^** units": "",
  "Pick another visible friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit that was not set up this turn and that is wholly within 18\" of this unit to be the target. Them, make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Each time a model in this unit is slain, before removing the model from play, pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit and roll a dice. On a 4+, inflict 1 mortal damage on that enemy unit.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, the first time an enemy unit ends a charge move within 3\" of the target, you can remove the target from the battlefield and set it up in reserve **masked by illusion**.": "",
  "Change your hero's Health characteristic to 8 and replace their melee weapon with **Great Horns**. In addition, your hero has the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** units": "",
  "Add 1 to casting rolls for this unit. In addition, subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks that target friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch Daemon^^** units while they are wholly within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "Roll a dice. Add the number of damage points allocated to the target this phase by this unit's shooting attacks to the roll. On a 5+,subtract 1 from save rolls for the target for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Your hero's melee weapon has **Anti-X (+1 Rend)**, where **X** is one of the following keywords: **^^Infantry^^**, **^^Cavalry^^**, **^^Monster^^**, **^^War Machine^^**, **^^Wizard^^**, or **^^Priest^^**.": "El arma de combate de tu héroe tiene **Anti-X (+1 Rend)**, donde **X** es una de las siguientes palabras clave: **^^Infantry^^**, **^^Cavalry^^**, **^^Monster^^**, **^^War Machine^^**, **^^Wizard^^** o **^^Priest^^**.",
  "Each time this unit or the replacement of this unit is destroyed, set up a replacement unit in reserve **masked by illusion**. Each friendly **Chaos Spawn of Tzeentch** unit can be replaced any number of times.": "",
  "If this unit is in combat, it can use a non-**^^Summon Spell^^** ability as if it were your hero phase, as if that ability had the **^^Unlimited^^** keyword and as if this unit had not cast any spells this turn.": "",
  "Make an unbinding roll of 2D6. If the roll exceeds the casting value, the spell is unbound and its effect is not resolved.\r\nIf the spell is unbound, add 1 to casting rolls for this unit for the rest of the phase.": "",
  "The next time this unit uses a non-**^^Summon Spell^^** ability this phase, do not make a casting roll as part of that ability. Instead, roll a dice. On a 2+, the spell is successfully cast and cannot be unbound.": "",
  "Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared a **^^Spell^^** ability for a **^^Wizard^^** within 30\" of this unit and the casting roll equalled or exceeded the spell's casting value and that spell has not been unbound": "",
  "Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared a **^^Spell^^** ability for a **^^Wizard^^** within 30\" of this unit and the casting roll equalled or exceeded the spell's casting value and that spell has not been unbound": "",
  "If this unit was picked to be the target of that spell, roll a dice. On a 4+, ignore the effect of that spell on this unit. This unit can use this ability more than once per phase but only once per **^^Spell^^** ability.": "Si esta unidad ha sido elegida como objetivo de ese hechizo, tira un dado. Con un 4+, ignora el efecto de ese hechizo sobre esta unidad. Esta unidad puede usar esta habilidad más de una vez por fase, pero solo una vez por cada habilidad de **^^Spell^^**.",
  "Roll a dice. Add 1 to the roll if the target was set up this turn, On a 3+, until the start of your next turn, other than the **Companion** weapon ability, weapon abilities for attacks that target that unit have no effect.": "",
  "Make an unbinding roll of 2D6. If the roll exceeds the casting roll for the spell, the spell is unbound and its effect is not resolved.\r\nIf the spell is unbound, add 1 to casting rolls for this unit for the rest of the phase.": "",
  "Roll a D3. Allocate a number of damage points to this unit equal to the roll (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points). Then, add 2 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's ranged weapons for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "While there is a visible friendly **^^Arcanite Hero^^** within this unit's combat range:\r\n• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for combat attacks that target that friendly **^^Arcanite Hero^^**.\r\n• Add 1 to hit rolls for this unit's combat attacks.": "",
  "Slain **Brimstone Horrors** cannot be returned to this unit. When setting up a replacement unit for this unit, **Brimstone Horror** models are ignored when determining the number of models in this unit, and you cannot pick them to be set up.": "",
  "This unit can immediately use a **^^Spell^^** ability. When it does so, measure the range and visibility of that **^^Spell^^** ability from the target. The target is treated as the caster for the purposes of other abilities such as 'Unbind'.": "",
  "The target can immediately use a **^^Spell^^** ability from the Lore of Change or the Lore of Fate.\r\n**Designer's Note**: *That spell does not count towards the number of **^^Spell^^** or **^^Banish^^** abilities the target can use this phase.*": "",
  "Until the start of your next turn:\r\n• If the target charged in the same turn, friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** units in combat with the target have **^^Strike-first^^**.\r\n• The target's weapons cannot be affected by the **Charge (+1 Damage)** weapon ability.": "",
  "If this unit charged this turn, pick 1 of the following effects to apply for the rest of the turn:\r\n• This unit's **Tzeentchian Spear and Vicious Beak** has **Crit (2 Hits)**\r\n• Add 1 to the Rend characteristic of this unit's **Tzeentchian Spear and Vicious Beak**.": "",
  "While you have 3 or more **fate points**, add 1 to hit rolls for this unit's attacks.\r\nWhile you have 6 or more **fate points**, add 1 to wound rolls for this unit's attacks.\r\nWhile you have 9 or more **fate points**, add 1 to the Rend characteristic of this unit's melee weapons.": "",
  "If that spell is successfully cast, roll a dice. On a 4+, after resolving the effect of that spell, this unit can immediately cast that spell a second time using the same casting roll. Do not count the second spell towards the number of **^^Spell^^** abilities this unit can use this turn.": "",
  "Roll a D3. On a 1, gain 1 **fate point**. On a 2+:\r\n• Inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.\r\n• This unit can immediately use a **^^Retreat^^** ability as if it were your movement phase. No mortal damage is inflicted on this unit by that **^^Retreat^^** ability.": "",
  "Add the **Disc's Teeth and Horns** weapon to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 14\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 7.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the following keywords: **^^Cavalry^^**, **^^Fly^^**.": "",
  "Add the **Screamers' Lamprey Bites** weapon to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 12\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 10.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the following keywords: **^^War Machine^^**, **^^Fly^^**.": "",
  "This unit can move a distance up to the value of the charge roll. It can move through the combat ranges of enemy units and must end that move within 1/2\" of the target. If it does so, this unit has charged.\r\nThen, if this unit charged this turn, inflict D3 mortal damage on each enemy **^^Manifestation^^** in combat with this unit.": "",
  "If any damage points were allocated to an enemy **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^** by this unit's attacks this turn and that enemy unit has been destroyed:\r\n• **Heal (7)** this unit.\r\n• Add 1 to this unit's power level for the rest of the battle.\r\nThis unit can be affected by this ability multiple times and the effects are cumulative.": "",
  "When using the 'Smoke and Mirrors' ability, if this unit is **masked by illusion**, you can pick a **^^Manifestation^^** (friendly or enemy) that was not set up in the same turn to be the target instead. If you do so, you must pick this unit to be the substitute. After setting up the substitute, the target is banished instead of being set up in reserve.": "",
  "Add 1 to casting rolls and unbinding rolls for friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch Wizards^^** while they are wholly within 12\" of this unit.\r\nIn addition, if a friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch Wizard^^** wholly within 12\" of this unit unbinds a spell, no command points are spent for that **^^Wizard^^** to use the 'Magical Intervention' command in that phase.": "",
  "The next time a friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit uses a **^^Spell^^** ability this phase, when picking targets for that spell, you can measure range and visibility from this terrain feature instead of from the caster, and your opponent can measure range and visibility to this terrain feature instead of to the caster for the purposes of the 'Unbind' ability.": "",
  "While this unit is within a friendly non-**^^Hero Arcanite^^** unit's combat range:\r\n• This unit has **^^Ward (4+)^^**.\r\n• Each time you make a successful ward roll for this unit, allocate 1 damage point to a friendly non-**^^Hero Arcanite^^** unit within this unit's combat range after the damage sequence for this unit has been resolved (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points).": "",
  "This unit's **Brimstone Horror** is a token. When this unit's **Blue Horror** is slain, place this unit's **Brimstone Horror** on the battlefield. Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's **Mighty Sorcerous Bolt** while its **Brimstone Horror** is on the battlefield. If you make an unmodified save roll of 1 for this unit, remove this unit's **Brimstone Horror** from the battlefield.": "",
  "While this unit is within a friendly non-**^^Hero^^** **^^Arcanite^^** unit's combat range:\r\n• This unit has **Ward (4+)**.\r\n• Each time you make a successful ward roll for this unit, allocate 1 damage point to a friendly non-**^^Hero^^** **^^Arcanite^^** unit within this unit's combat range after the damage sequence for this unit has been resolved (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points).": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, place the **Idolarcs** of all other friendly **Jade Obelisk** units next to their respective units. Then, place this unit's **Idolarc** next to the target.\r\nWhile a friendly **Idolarc** is next to an enemy unit, subtract 1\" from that enemy unit's Move characteristic for each **fate point** you have. This ability cannot reduce an enemy unit's Move characteristic below half its unmodified value.": "",
  "Each time a model in this unit is slain, before removing the model from play, pick 1 of the following effects: \r\n***Split:*** Pick a friendly **Blue Horrors and Brimstone Horrors** unit within 12\" of this unit. Return up to 2 slain **Blue Horror** models to that unit. \r\n***Petty Vengeance:*** Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target, then roll a dice. On a 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.": "",
  "This unit can move a distance up to its Move characteristic. It can pass through other models and the combat ranges of enemy units, but it cannot end that move in combat. Then, pick up to 1 enemy unit that this unit passed across during that move to be the target. Roll a dice for each model in the target unit. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.\r\n**Designer's Note:** *This unit can use this ability even if it is in combat.*": "",
  "Pick 1 of the following effects:\r\n• If there is only 1 friendly **Argent Shard** on the battlefield, set up another **Argent Shard** wholly within 12\" of this terrain feature, more than 1\" from all other terrain features, more than 3\" from all objectives and more than 9\" from all enemy units.\r\n• Remove this terrain feature from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield more than 1\" from all other terrain features, more than 3\" from all objectives and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "Roll a dice for each **Blue Horror** model in this unit that is slain. For each 3+, if there are fewer **Brimstone Horrors** models in this unit than its starting size, you can add 1 **Brimstone Horrors** model to this unit.\r\n**Designer's Note:** *Dice are only rolled for Blue Horror models that are currently slain – models that have been slain and returned to this unit do not count until they are slain once more. When adding Brimstone Horrors to this unit, do not count slain Brimstone Horrors towards the maximum.*": "",
  "If this unit has not already **engineered the outcome** this battle round, instead of making a casting roll, unbinding roll, banishment roll, hit roll, wound roll, or save roll for a visible friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit, this unit can **engineer the outcome**.\r\nIf the roll would have been a D6 roll, you can use a value of 6 for the roll, you can use a value of 6 for it that cannot be modified. If the roll would have been a 2D6 roll, you can use a value of 9 for it that cannot be modified.": "",
  "Roll 2 dice, pick either result, then apply the corresponding effect for the rest of the turn:\r\n**1** No effect.\r\n**2-3** **Heal (D3)** each friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** target. Inflict D3 mortal damage on each enemy target.\r\n**4** Friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** targets can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if they used a **^^Run^^** ability in the same turn. Enemy targets cannot use **^^Run^^** abilities.\r\n**5** Add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made by friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** targets. Subtract 1 from hit rolls for attacks made by enemy targets.\r\n**6** Add 1 to wound rolls for attacks made by  friendly **^^Disciples of Tzeentch^^** targets. Subtract 1 from wound rolls for attacks made by enemy targets.": ""
}
